What is printed when the following class fields are displayed?

```java
class SensorState {
    int count;
    double temperature;
    boolean active;
    String label;
}
public class Main {
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        SensorState s = new SensorState();
        System.out.println(s.count + " " + s.temperature + " " + s.active + " " + s.label);
    }
}
```

